    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> be the greatest integer less than or equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8721;</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mn>100</mn></munderover><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></msup><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to:"
